      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I use a generic 3D cube for scale.  the cube's scale X Y and Z are in meters, so set to 1 x 1 x 1 would be exactly 1 meter cube.  Average human height is 1.8m   Use that as a base.   Unless you WANT to be giant (like me :3)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
